msgid "Welcome to Dar es Salaam's premier beauty and hair salon. We specialize in creating a relaxing atmosphere where every detail is designed to accentuate your natural features."
msgstr "Karibu kwenye salon ya kuvutia ya k.top hapa Dar es Salaam. Tunajitolea kuunda mazingira ya utulivu ambapo kila kiasi imepangwa kukufanya uonekane vizuri."

msgid "Our expert stylists work closely with you to discover designs that reflect your individuality. Come experience the personal touch at Lumina Salon."
msgstr "Wafanyabiasha wetu wana kazi nawe kwa karibu kugundua mitindo inayoonyesha tabia yako. Njoo uone furaha ya binafsi kwenye Lumina Salon."

msgid "Come and experience the personal touch at Lumina Salon. We believe everyone deserves to look and feel their best."
msgstr "Njoo uone furaha ya binafsi kwenye Lumina Salon. Tunaamini kila mtu anastahili kuonekana na kujiona vizuri."

msgid "Our bright, comfortable, and relaxing environment is designed to help you blossom into your most radiant self."
msgstr "Mazingira yetu ya wasana na ya utulivu imeundwa kukusaidia kuwa nguvu zaidi."

msgid "We're curating an aesthetic that expresses your unique personality. Our passion is helping people achieve transformations that boost confidence."
msgstr "Tunaunda urembo unaoonyesha tabia yako ya kipekee. bidii yetu ni kusaidia watu kupata mabadiliko ya kujaminisha."

msgid "RELAX & RENEW AT OUR SALON"
msgstr "JI relaxe & Upya kwenye Salon"

msgid "Step into our serene sanctuary and walk out feeling rejuvenated. Our welcoming environment is designed for you to express your vision and needs."
msgstr "Ingia kwenye makulifu yetu na utoke ukihisi kurejeshwa. Mazingira yetu ya karibuni imeundwa kukuwezesha kueleza maono yako."

msgid "Whether you need a trim to refresh your current style, a total makeover, or special event styling, our skilled team delivers exceptional results."
msgstr "Iwe unacheki mcheduo wa kuboresha mtindo wako, Badiliko kamili, au utendi maalum, timu yetu ya wataalamu hutoa matokeo ya kipekee."

msgid "Our stylists are trained in the latest coloring techniques and will start by getting clear on your needs and vision."
msgstr "Wafanyabiasha wetu wamefundwa kwenye rangi za hivi karibuni na wataanza kupata wazi kwenye mahitaji yako."

msgid "Let's have a chat about your hair, your vision, and your inspiration. We'll talk about the smartest ways to get your hair healthy, happy, and beautiful. Additionally, we'll let you know exactly how much your services will cost before we begin."
msgstr "Tuangalie nywele zako, maono yako, na ufunzo. Tutazungumza kuhusu njema zaidi ya kupata nywele zdrav. Pia, tutakuambia kiasi gani huduma zako zitagharimu kabla ya kuanza."

msgid "Expert haircuts and hair color techniques including balayage, highlights, lowlights, babylights, and ombre. We specialize in customized techniques for all hair types, including blonde hair experts and curly hair specialists. We deliver the best result possible every time."
msgstr "Mikata yaKitaalamu na technique za rangi ikiwa ni balayage, highlights, lowlights, babylights, na ombre. Tuna specialized kwenye technique zote za nywele, ikiwa ni wataalamu wa nywele za blonde na nywele za curl. Tunatoa matokeo bora kila wakati."

msgid "Transform your look with our premium human hair extension options including weaves, fusions, tape-in, and clip-in extensions. Our stylists will help decide what's right for you, ensuring the best experience with natural-looking results."
msgstr "Badilisha muonekane wako na options zetu za nywele za kibinadamu ikijumuisha weaves, fusions, tape-in, na clip-in extensions. Wafanyabiasha wetu wataasaidia kufanya maamuzi yaliyo sahihi kwako, kuhakikisha matokeo asili."

msgid "Get luscious lashes 24/7 with our professional eyelash extension services. We offer classic, volume, mega volume, and hybrid options. Whether you're looking for the hottest lash extensions in town, we've got you covered."
msgstr "Pata ma eyelashes Mazuri kila saa na huduma zetu za Eyelash extension. Tunatoa classic, volume, mega volume, na hybrid options. Ukitafuta Eyelash extensions bora mjini, tayari."

msgid "Save time in your daily routine with our semi-permanent eyebrow solutions. We offer powder brow and ombre brow services, plus threading services to shape your brows perfectly."
msgstr "Weka muda katika routine yako ya kila siku na sulutions zetu za semi-permanent eyebrow. Tunatoa powder brow na ombre brow services, pamoja na threading services kuchapa eyebrows zako vizuri."

msgid "Professional makeup services for weddings, special events, and photoshoots. From a natural look to full glam, we'll help you look as good as you feel for any occasion."
msgstr "Huduma za makeup za kustaafu, events maalum, na photoshoots. Kutoka kwenye kuko na kufika kwenye glam kamili, tutakusaidia kuonekana vizuri kila tukio."

msgid "Special occasion styling and makeup services for your big day. We offer bride and bridal party packages. We can come to your venue for on-site services, or you can visit us at the salon."
msgstr "Huduma za utendi na makeup kwenye siku yako kuu. Tunatoa bride na bridal party packages. Tunaweza kukuja kwenye mahali pako kwa huduma za eneo, au unaweza kutembelea salon."

msgid "SERVICE MENU"
msgstr "MENI YA HUDUMA"

msgid "Healthy Hair Services For All Hair Types"
msgstr "Huduma za Nywele Afya Kwa Aina Zote za Nywele"

msgid "Lumina Salon offers professional hair care services for all hair types. Enjoy a relaxing scalp massage with every wash, hot towel compress, and meticulous attention to detail. We use only quality products to ensure the best results for your hair."
msgstr "Lumina Salon inatoa huduma za huduma za nywele kwa aina zote za nywele. Furahia massage ya scalp kila wewe, towel ya joto, na makini kwenye kila kiasi. Tunatumia bidii tu ili kuhakikisha matokeo bora kwa nywele zako."

